# OSIMAGE PLUGIN - packing an image
#
#        two defined methods are mandatory:
#        - pack   returns kernel_file_name,ramdisk_file_name upon success
#        - build  returns image_file_name upon success
#
#        one defined variable is mandatory:
#        - systemroot   where the installer mounts the image on the node

# Plugin selection based on the following search path and priority:
#
# 1 distribution + osrelease  e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/image/redhat9.py
#                                  or plugins/osimage/operations/image/redhat/9.py
# 2 distribution              e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/image/redhat/default.py  or  redhat.py
# 3 default                   e.g. plugins/osimage/operations/image/default.py
